call) once inspected: launch() below must make the same call with the same argument types.

Rules (references/mono-layer-ut.md section 2):
  * one process a rank and the subject's real peer buffer: build the deployed runner class
    over `group`, never a single-process stand-in;
  * weights: TP / EP shards seeded per rank, replicated tensors identical on every rank; no
    norm weight all ones, no two norms equal (assert it);
  * index dtypes as served; page tables over a shuffled pool; a sliding-window pool, if the
    model has one, is a different tensor behind a non-identity page map;
  * kv_targets / writes name exactly the slots a launch writes: the harness poisons those and
    counts every other changed byte as kv_stray.
